  yarnScript: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 4d7f3512f5884b0fbc9b845094d30641, type: 3}
  yarnNodeName: Start
  Phrases:
  - Oh... Another one. Sleeping Beauty decides to roll outta the dirt. Took you long
    enough.
  - You okay? No? Good. Welcome to the forest, not just your average collection of
    trees, oh no... This one's got thoughts. Feelings. Maybe even a superiority complex.
  - "Honestly? It\u2019s smarter than you. But don\u2019t take it personally. Most
    rocks are, too."
  - ...
  - "I know what you\u2019re thinking. \u201CA crab? In a forest?\u201D"
  - "I know what you\u2019re thinking. \u201CA crab? In a forest?\u201D"
  - "Yeah, genius. A crab. Walking, talking, and mildly judgmental. But hey \u2014
    I\u2019m not the one who passed out in sentient shrubbery wearing yesterday\u2019s
    trauma. That\u2019s a you problem."
  - ...
  - You should try escaping. Assuming you like living. Or whatever it is you humans
    call your half-conscious flailing.
  - "But don\u2019t get cozy. This place? It... adapts. Warps. Chews up people like
    you and spits out something with too many eyes."
  - "Anyway! I\u2019ll be around. Lurking. Judging. You know. Like family."
